Subject: [PATCH] DOS-PORT: patch 0073 -- fold SDL/0147's upload-PIO + prepsong
 diagnostics into AUDIOPRB.LOG (S7-GUS)

Same rollup-of-rollups pattern as every prior fold-in this sub-
investigation. Adds three new fields to the existing DOS-PORT audioprb
log line: uploadpio(...) and uploadsample(...) (SDL patch SDL/0147,
each also carrying a bytes= total for computing effective us/byte
throughput) and prepsong(...) (patch 0072's gus_sink_prepare_song()
call-site bracket). Discard-snapshots all three before the slot loop,
same attribution-correctness reasoning as every earlier field.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VVzc2V3qXnVbYZC693CTWt
